	JMP	RNOXDR	/NO CHECK DONE			/C028
	RXIXDR		/CLEAR IT			/M033
	JMP	RZERR4	/TRANSFER READY ILLEGAL		/A026
RNOXDR,	RXISDN		/DONE?				/M033
