/D026/
/D026/	THIS ROUTINE DETERMINES WHETHER THE CHAR TO BE DISPLAYED IS A
/D026/	77 OR NOT.	IF A 77 IS DETECTED IT IS IGNORED AND A SWITCH IS
/D026/	SET TO PRINT THE NEXT CHAR IN THE BUFFER.  IF UPON ENTRY THE SW
/D026/	IS SET THE SW IS CLEARED AND RETURN IS MADE TO THE CALL+2 (PRINT)
/D026/	IF NOT 77 AND NOT SW SET RETURN IS MADE TO CALL+3 TO CONTINUE
/D026/
