/ THE ABOVE REVISIONS ARE FOR DECMATE II (CONDOR)
/ The edit history below is for DECmate I

/070	GDH	29-MAR-82	Fixed secondary port error detect (and port
/				 hang condition).
/069	GDH	01-MAR-82	Fixed LP input interrupt handler to handle
/				 incoming input when handler not loaded.
/068	GDH	26-FEB-82	Re-ordered interrupt chain to put printer input
