	LDREG		/ CR0A	/ ISSUE THE END OF INTERRUPT COMMAND
	CLA			/
	>	/ END IFDEF CONDOR ------------------------------------	/A075

	JMP	H2OJMS 		/ OUTPUT -- JUMP TO HANDLE IT.

