/	RESET THE BUFFER.						/A123

/D136	H2ORST,	CLA							/A123
H2BWT,	TAD	H2BFLG	/ WAIT UNTIL LINE IS NOT BUSY			/A123
	SZA CLA								/A123
	JMP	H2BWT	/ GO WAIT SOME MORE				/A123
