	JMS I	XGETNU		/GET THE ALPHABET NUMBER
	JMP	TOPA8		/NON-NUMERIC, JUST RETURN
/
	TAD	NUMMER+2	/GET THE SELECTED ALPHABET NUMMER
	DCA	TDISPL		/STORE IN PRIMITIVES COMMAND BLOCK
/
	JMS	DOTXT		/SEND IT TO THE PRIMS
/
TOPA8,	TAD	CHAR		/GET THE NEXT CHAR, IF ANY
